{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rCZ52jMWQT1794749614.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本地聯賽盃晉級組次圈，理文2-1反勝大埔。</p><p></p><p>半場0-0，藍衫理文69分鐘先失守，華力臣在禁區邊射入，為大埔領先1-0，但理文用了3分鐘就追平。</p><p></p><p>費利佩扣過守衛，射門省中人，改變方向入網，72分鐘追平1-1，加上保亞馬天尼斯在補時1分鐘射入罰球，理文反勝2-1，晉級第三圈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:22:13.285142+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T13:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T22:21:50.931052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:42.227913+00:00","content_hash":"7e646909bc8329bcb0273d6bb4dd83bf369480282d40bf691c3e169af76db9f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}